### Topic 43 - sample requests (VS Code "REST Client" extension: click "Send Request")
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Which database am I using? Which migrations ran?
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/db-info

### All books (inserted by migration V2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books

### Filter by author
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books?author=martin

### One book
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/1

### Create a book
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Spring in Action",
  "author": "Craig Walls",
  "price": 650.00,
  "publishedYear": 2022,
  "isbn": "978-1617297571"
}

### Validation error (blank title, negative price) -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "author": "Nobody",
  "price": -5
}

### Delete a book
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/books/4

### Unknown id -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/999
